  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Single line representation of truck routes within the Halifax Regional Municipality, derived from the Street Centrelines dataset and segmentation. Truck routes are defined in <a href='https://www.halifax.ca/city-hall/legislation-by-laws/by-law-t-400' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>By-Law T400</a>.<div>The dataset was created to map truck routes as described in By-Law T400.<br /></div><div><div>If there are any discrepancies between this data and that from the Truck Route By-Law T400, the By-Law should be taken as the most accurate. Truck routes on Provincial and Halifax Harbour Bridges are omitted from this dataset. </div><div><a href='https://hrm.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/6f20e8e44dc84404a375556096f4ce9e/data' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Metadata</a></div></div>"
